        "Rows: 46 as printed, including Board headings (I-XI) and the 'Government University:—' sub-heading as rows with other cells empty.",
        "Board heading rows carry the heading in the Key column, except 'Government University:—' which is in the School column as printed (indented).",
        "Women's Normal School and Midwife Training School have figures only in the Women column; Men cell empty in the original.",
        "C21 Supplementary School of Finance: dotted leader but no figure printed; Men cell written '...'.",
        "No printed totals; table ends with XI on this page (Figure 14 map follows on p. 135); no private-school section found on this page.",
        "F1 added: continuation printed at the top of p. 136 (image p0152, headed 'Government and Private Schools—Continued'): sections XII-XV and the printed totals, 27 rows (26 school/heading rows + total row). p0151 (p. 135) is the Figure 14 map and carries no table.",
        "Total check: Men column sums to 13,729 and Women column to 681 (both pages, all rows read), matching the printed totals exactly. Total rows now 73 including the total row.",
        "C27 Military Official School: 'Closed' printed in the Men column. A14 Cha Chung Agricultural School: dotted leader, no figure printed; cells empty. Earlier note 'table ends with XI on this page' is superseded: the list continues on p. 136."
      ],
